1
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,680
Why are you all looking at me

2
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,600
like it's a final farewell?

3
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,380
I remember

4
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,360
telling you on my very first day here

5
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,960
that this case

6
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,480
must be investigated to the very end.

7
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,240
Whether I'm here or not,

8
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,160
I hope none of you

9
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,440
will ever let up.

10
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,780
Can you promise me that?

11
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:08,860
We promise!

12
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:11,600
Thank you, everyone.

13
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:11,260
Come on, come on.

14
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:12,060
Cheers.

15
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,320
Mr. Du,

16
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,700
that move of yours...

17
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:18,700
getting someone else to do your dirty work...

18
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,500
was brilliant!

19
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:21,740
Now that Geng Qing

20
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,060
has taken such a massive fall,

21
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:24,180
know what people outside are saying?

22
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:25,640
"He got arrested!"

23
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,040
Fantastic!

24
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,040
He's only suspended.

25
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:32,160
Everybody knows:

26
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,260
after a suspension,

27
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,160
come formal charges and arrest.

28
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,820
We can finally relax for real.

29
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,720
For the next few days, we'll play cards

30
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:40,580
and drink.

31
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:41,580
Every single one of you must join!

32
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:42,780
It's my treat!

33
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:43,860
Come on, come on!

34
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,360
We play till dawn! Deal the cards!

35
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,020
Mr. Du,

36
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,860
I heard

37
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,420
that for the Lu'an project,

38
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,520
you're completely ready.

39
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,760
They'll restart the bidding right away.

40
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:02,120
You really have connections everywhere!

41
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,240
This time it must be

42
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,020
open, fair, and just.

43
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:08,260
We can't give anyone leverage again.

44
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,800
Don't worry.

45
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,980
It's foolproof.

46
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:22,840
Who is it?

47
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,720
Hello, Auntie.

48
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:28,020
Um, my name is Lin Lan.

49
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,060
I'm Geng Qing's colleague.

50
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,280
Please, come in!

51
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,320
Come on in.

52
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:32,800
Sorry to bother you, Auntie.

53
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,440
Not at all, not at all!

54
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,500
I'm so sorry.

55
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:36,620
I should've come during the day,

56
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:38,680
but we were just so busy at work today.

57
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:39,860
Dear,

58
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:40,660
how old are you?

59
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:41,620
Are you married?

60
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,200
Marri—

61
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,600
I'm not married.

62
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:47,420
Um...

63
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:49,100
is Team Leader Geng home?

64
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,520
Don't even get me started.

65
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,960
Please, you have to save him!

66
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,640
Qing!

67
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,480
Xiao Qing!

68
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:55,340
Auntie...

69
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,920
Geng Qing!

70
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:58,520
Someone's here to see you!

71
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,100
I'm heading out for groceries!

72
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:01,980
You two go ahead and talk!

73
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:03,960
Mom...

74
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,720
Your mom...

75
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,180
is quite sweet.

76
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,020
Did you need something?

77
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:15,500
I came to check on you.

78
00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:21,700
Have a seat.

79
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,160
Have some chips.

80
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:39,320
I don't want chips.

81
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:41,700
How are you holding up?

82
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:42,640
Me?

83
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,480
I'm...

84
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,040
doing pretty well.

85
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:48,120
A game I bought sat unopened for six months,

86
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,000
and now I've almost beaten it.

87
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,900
You're taking this pretty well.

88
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:54,880
What else can I do?

89
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,440
Let me ask you.

90
00:04:58,660 --> 00:04:59,660
That 2,500,

91
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,040
did you really not take it?

92
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,580
Zero tolerance within our ranks is absolutely right.

93
00:05:05,140 --> 00:05:06,180
Back then,

94
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,760
I didn't take the money,

95
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:09,460
but I failed to report it in time.

96
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:11,120
That's my own fault.

97
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,240
So,

98
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,280
I can't blame anyone else.

99
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,960
You usually seem like such a sharp guy.

100
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:18,360
How'd you get a friend like Du Qingbo?

101
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,740
Good thing it was you.

102
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,040
If it had been anyone else,

103
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,540
it might've been even worse.

104
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,820
If your eyesight is failing,

105
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,240
let's get you a pair of glasses.

106
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,200
Sure.

107
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:32,000
Do you think I need glasses for nearsightedness,

108
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,240
or reading glasses?

109
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:36,100
I spoke with our colleagues at the procuratorate.

110
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:37,200
Right now, Du Qingbo and his group

111
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,480
are only targeting the experts.

112
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,540
That's not the same as illegal bidding.

113
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:42,060
The sentencing is completely different.

114
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,460
Our chain of evidence is incomplete.

115
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,040
It's tough for the procuratorate to act.

116
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,400
That's what I've been worried about, too.

117
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:51,540
If this time

118
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,920
we fail to catch them,

119
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,680
and let them win the project

120
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,940
and divide the spoils,

121
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:57,460
well,

122
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:59,460
the next time they commit a crime,

123
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:01,100
they'll be even craftier and more covert,

124
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,200
and even harder to catch.

125
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,760
So,

126
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,400
in this Lu'an Group case,

127
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,640
you must pursue it to the very end.

128
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,720
Us?

129
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:10,700
Wait,

130
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:11,600
what about you?

131
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,200
My duty right now is to rest while on suspension.

132
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,320
Hey, don't say that.

133
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:16,720
I'm only good at catching suspects.

134
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,080
I can't handle the rest.

135
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,200
The Task Force

136
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,280
can't do without you as its leader.

137
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,340
This report,

138
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:28,240
I've read through it many times.

139
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,500
Comrade Jianguo,

140
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,440
help me evaluate this as well.

141
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,760
Between this Jia Dongping

142
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:35,360
and Zhou Zhiyuan of the 3rd Bureau,

143
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:38,040
are their cases really the same in nature?

144
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,120
Secretary,

145
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,640
we're thinking along the exact same lines.

146
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:44,900
Zhou Zhiyuan

147
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,520
was probably just used by others.

148
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:48,200
Jia Dongping is different.

149
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:51,520
His answers during questioning were watertight.

150
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,920
I'm afraid behind him,

151
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,300
an expert has been coaching him.

152
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:57,900
Then that makes it clear.

153
00:06:59,900 --> 00:07:00,700
Comrade Jianguo,

154
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:03,080
I think our strategy

155
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,220
needs to go a step or two further.

156
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,600
Internally, we hold ourselves to strict standards,

157
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,560
neither wrongly accusing nor letting anyone off.

158
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:12,500
If Comrade Geng Qing really did something wrong,

159
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:13,700
I will never condone it.

160
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:15,460
But then again,

161
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,700
if someone is intentionally slinging mud

162
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:21,020
and framing our Discipline and Inspection Committee cadre,

163
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:23,480
then right at this moment,

164
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,960
we need to stay calm and take the hit,

165
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,160
take it without batting an eye,

166
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:31,260
and turn it to our advantage.

167
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,120
Do you mean

168
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,640
we use the opportunity

169
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,420
of them slinging mud at us?

170
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,660
I don't believe for a second

171
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:40,900
that when I announce at the meeting

172
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:43,300
suspending Geng Qing from the Task Force,

173
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:45,540
the ones framing him won't find out.

174
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:47,600
That is precisely when

175
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:49,380
we must keep our eyes locked on them.

176
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:51,780
Right when they think their plot has succeeded

177
00:07:52,060 --> 00:07:53,620
and let their guard down,

178
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:55,180
we catch them off guard

179
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,300
and strike the decisive blow.

180
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,780
Understood.

181
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,920
You're going abroad with Yanyan Wednesday.

182
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,980
Wednesday?

183
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,680
Isn't that when Lu'an Energy opens bids?

184
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,360
Did something happen?

185
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,280
Nothing.

186
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:27,300
I'm not leaving.

187
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,680
I'm staying here with you.

188
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,200
You guys go first.

189
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,480
Listen to me.

190
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,400
It was 2,500 a month,

191
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,060
only 15,000 in total.

192
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,040
I'd never take it, no matter how hard up.

193
00:08:56,540 --> 00:08:58,920
I did sign for Geng Qing,

194
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:01,320
but all the money went to Du Qingbo.

195
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:02,720
He said

196
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,100
he passed it all to Geng Qing.

197
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:09,600
Why didn't you verify it with Geng Qing?

198
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:11,600
He didn't bring it up,

199
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,080
and I felt awkward asking.

200
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,080
Think carefully.

201
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,360
Is there anything else?

202
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,520
I remember now.

203
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,140
Once, in the car,

204
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,860
when I gave the service fee to Du Qingbo,

205
00:09:22,860 --> 00:09:24,540
he opened the storage compartment.

206
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:27,760
Every time I gave him the service fee,

207
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:29,560
it was in this special envelope.

208
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,080
He didn't give it to Geng Qing on time,

209
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,560
or maybe never gave it at all.

210
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:38,020
Regarding the report on Comrade Geng Qing,

211
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,580
following an in-depth investigation,

212
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:42,400
that Comrade Geng Qing took illegal fees

213
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,660
has been found untrue.

214
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,020
It has been decided

215
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,540
to reinstate Comrade Geng Qing

216
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:48,300
as head of the Task Force.

217
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,320
Keep this strictly confidential.

218
00:09:50,660 --> 00:09:52,420
Proceed with the investigation.

219
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,680
Understood.

220
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:08,760
Thank you, everyone.

221
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,080
I'm back.

222
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:12,280
Until the Lu'an Energy bidding opens,

223
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,960
there are only three days left.

224
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:16,120
We must make every second count.

225
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,620
Now,

226
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:19,460
let's report on our progress.

227
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:20,900
Gong Jianlin hasn't been found yet.

228
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,660
As for our current evidence

229
00:10:22,660 --> 00:10:24,080
against Jinxin Company,

230
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,920
we only have them targeting the experts.

231
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:27,980
There's progress with Lu Qiming and Tao Xinliang,

232
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,140
but

233
00:10:29,260 --> 00:10:30,600
gathering evidence will still take time.

234
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:33,400
The redrawn expert list looks clean for now.

235
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,600
Then

236
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,380
only one breakthrough remains.

237
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,580
You mean...

238
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:42,080
We must crack Jia Dongping.

239
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:44,780
Secretary,

240
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,560
Jia traded money for power with officials,

241
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,320
making him an accomplice

242
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,560
in duty-related crimes.

243
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,720
I request permission

244
00:10:51,940 --> 00:10:53,040
to place him under detention.

245
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,020
I approve.

246
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,500
Geng Qing.

247
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,560
Given your special situation right now,

248
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:59,520
everything must strictly go by the book.

249
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,260
Yes, sir.
